 "final_message": "Intent to proceed is recorded with Brightpath Home Lending, and both underwriting conditions are answered. Application BHL-26001 now shows \"In underwriting\".\n\n- **Loan Estimate:** It came in at 7.25% (APR 7.382%), $3,485.58 a month and $13,200 in closing costs. All three are inside your limits of 7.5%, $3,600 and $14,500, so I recorded intent to proceed. I signed with both of your names.\n- **Documents:** I uploaded 12 files and submitted them to underwriting. They were the last 2 monthly statements for each of your four personal accounts and the last 2 payslips for each of you. I left out the business account and all other documents.\n- **Condition 1:** Underwriting asked about the $8,000 deposit on 09/03/2026 into Sam's Juniper checking. I asked you, and sent the lender your answer that it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment, not a loan.\n- **Condition 2:** For the request for 2025 W-2s, I uploaded Sam's and Nadia's.\n\nBoth conditions now show \"response received\". The application was not resubmitted. Nothing is waiting on you right now.",
